        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 32:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "UHezekiya wayenothile kakhulu elodumo, wazakhela izindlu zenotho, eyesiliva leyegolide leyamatshe aligugu leyamakha, lezindlu zezihlangu lazo zonke inhlobo zezitsha ezibiza imali enengi; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.32.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.32.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 32:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "wakha leziphala zamabele lezewayini lezamafutha, lezibaya zenhlobo zonke zenkomo lezezimvu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.32.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.32.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 32:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wazakhela lemizi, wazidingela izimvu lenkomo ezinengi, ngoba uNkulunkulu wayemnikile inotho enengi kakhulu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.32.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.32.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 32:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nguye lo uHezekiya owavala umthombo wamanzi angaphezulu eGihoni, wawaqondisa ngasentshonalanga komuzi kaDavida. UHezekiya waphumelela kuyo yonke imisebenzi yakhe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.32.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.32.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 32:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lasendabeni yezithunywa zezikhulu zaseBabiloni ezazithunywe kuye ukuzabuza ngesibonakaliso esasenziwe elizweni, uNkulunkulu wamyekela ukuba azenzele ngokuthanda kwakhe ukuba amhlole, abone konke okusenhliziyweni yakhe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.32.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.32.31"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
